  "equipment_type": "VRF / split AC gateway",
  "applies_to": "Procon MelcoBEMS MINI (A1M) on the CN105/CN92 connector of a Mitsubishi Electric Air-To-Air indoor unit, installation manual v1.1.11 (firmware 3.0.28 for revision 2-4 hardware, 3.1.1 for revision 5).",
  "summary": "Procon protocol converter that plugs into the CN105/CN92 connector of one Mitsubishi Electric split indoor unit and serves Modbus RTU or BACnet MS/TP on RS-485. For Air-To-Air units it exposes mode, setpoint, fan, vane and on/off, room temperature and fault code, the BMS room-sensor setpoint offset and deadband auto-changeover settings.",
